Slets say that we have a company that wants to buy some addresse:
if the company is huge, it can buy either class A or B

it can also buy a class C address if its a small company
if it opted for class C, it has 255 available addresses!
eventho the company opted for class C, it still wasted too many addresses!

lets understand how:

say that we have 2 routers connected with each other via a cable


                            R1 <--------------------------------> R2
when I have 2 routers connected with each otehr via a single cable, this called 
point-to-point neterwork                    

the network is now connected phsyically
