now we need to set the network on the level of software. this means lets set the ip addresses

since we have class C
its gonna like this:    196.168.1.0/24  
this indicates that only the last octal is avaialbel for our hosts: range 256-2


--> we know also that we mostly give IP addresses to routers, and not devices
so here we have 2 routers: R1 and R2

R1: 196.168.1.1
R2: 196.168.1.2

