say that a compnay has 3k employees, this means 3k devices
obivoulsy it cant use the class C, as its too small: range 1-254

the solution is class B
B class is too large for 3k ip addresses, so a lot of addreses went to waste!!

65k-3K == 62k wasted ip addresseso!

